/*Query 1 🏙️: We have witness testimony that the suspect was in Carnival City on January 13th, 2021, with a reported sighting at 5:01 pm.
Using cell phone location data, list all suspects who were in that location at that time.
Display their first and last names, their location data, as well as the timestamp.
Assume that the dates are stored in the MM/DD/YY HH:MM format.*/ 
SELECT s.suspect_first_name, s.suspect_last_name, loc.cell_location, loc.date_time
FROM suspect_info s
JOIN location_info loc
ON s.suspect_id = loc.suspect_id
WHERE cell_location = "Carnival City"
AND loc.date_time = "01/13/21 17:01"; 


/*Query 2 🪪: The suspect was able to break into the facility that housed the poodle because of a stolen employee ID card. Based on witness testimony of an overheard phone call, detectives believe that the suspect stole the ID from a close friend and that the friend was some type of specialist.
Find suspects with associates who have occupational titles containing the word “Specialist,” and who have a relationship to the suspect labeled as “Friend”.
Columns to retrieve: suspect_first_name, suspect_last_name, associate_alias, occupation, relationship_to_suspect*/ 
SELECT s.suspect_first_name, s.suspect_last_name, assoc.associate_alias, assoc.occupation, assoc.relationship_to_suspect
FROM suspect_info s
JOIN associates_info assoc
ON s.suspect_id = assoc.suspect_id
WHERE assoc.relationship_to_suspect = "Friend"
AND assoc.occupation LIKE "%Specialist%"; 


/*Query 3 🚗: A key witness was able to see the suspect’s getaway vehicle. The vehicle was a minivan and the witness claimed that the license plate ended in “D0G” (D-zero-G).
Find suspects who own a minivan with a license plate that ends with “D0G”.
Columns to retrieve: suspect_first_name, suspect_last_name, cell_location, car_model, license_plate*/ 
SELECT s.suspect_first_name, s.suspect_last_name, loc.cell_location, v.car_model, v.license_plate
FROM suspect_info s
JOIN vehicle_info v 
ON s.suspect_id = v.suspect_id 
JOIN location_info loc
ON s.suspect_id = loc.suspect_id
WHERE v.license_plate LIKE "%D0G"; 


/*Query 4 🍭: The detectives have created a list of keywords and want to know if any alibis contain these words: “dog”, “cotton”, and “candy”.
Find all suspects that have an alibi that contains the word “dog”, “cotton”, or “candy”.
Columns to retrieve: suspect_first_name, suspect_last_name, alibi_statement*/ 
SELECT s.suspect_first_name, s.suspect_last_name, al.alibi_statement
FROM suspect_info s
JOIN alibi_info al
ON s.suspect_id = al.suspect_id 
WHERE al.alibi_statement LIKE "%dog%" 
OR al.alibi_statement LIKE "%cotton%" 
OR al.alibi_statement LIKE "%candy%";


/*Query 5 🗺️: Find all suspects whose data location and alibi location do not match.
Columns to retrieve: suspect_id, suspect_first_name, suspect_last_name, cell_location, alibi_location*/
SELECT s.suspect_id, s.suspect_first_name, s.suspect_last_name, loc.cell_location, al.alibi_location 
FROM suspect_info s
JOIN location_info loc
ON s.suspect_id = loc.suspect_id
JOIN alibi_info al
ON s.suspect_id = al.suspect_id
WHERE loc.cell_location <> al.alibi_location; 

